Package: dataxplore
Title: Data exploration and bias assessment tool
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Francesca", "Mancini", , "framan@ceh.ac.uk", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: An application to explore species occurrence data and assess
    biases in space, time, taxonomy and environmental space.  The
    application is an interface to the R package OccAssess and the ROBITT
    framework.
